;
; How Pinhole files one photo in MYRA (pinhole_rules.h PH7): its number,
; its album, its size in bytes, its width and height in pixels, whether a
; place tag was added with the owner's permit (0 or 1) and when it was
; taken (ms since 1970).
^ZXPINHOLE(photo:i9) = album:i4! ^ bytes:i12! ^ width:i5! ^ height:i5! ^ placed:i1! ^ stamp:i15!
